# QRP UI agent contract

1. Inspect before editing (route, API client, backend handler). Cite paths.
2. Backend is authority. No fake data. Zero = API returned 0. Missing = "Not reported". Failed = error + retry.
3. Sprint done only with: build + typecheck + vitest (+ Playwright when touched flows). Screenshots in `docs/qa/<sprint>/` when requested.
4. Max planning docs per sprint: `QRP_AUDIT.md`, `QRP_TRACKER.md`, `QRP_STACK.md` — only with code in same change.
5. Never ship: dead buttons, horizontal KPI carousel at ≥1024px, raw ULID as display name, raw enums in UI.
6. One design system (existing Tailwind + shadcn tokens). `motion` for draggable dashboards only where integrated.
7. Old routes redirect; preserve RBAC and API contracts.
8. Draggable home widgets: use `components/ui/draggable-widget-grid.tsx` + real API slices — not stock AI observability demos.

